    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark mystery unfolds\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow five-year-old Martin and his friends as they uncover a twisted cult\u2019s secrets in a town where reality is breaking down, filled with sci-fi elements and mysterious experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story with Sci-Fi and Psychological Thriller Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle and Exploration Gameplay, uncovering secret experiments in a sci-fi setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art Style with Immersive Sound Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Chapters (15-20 minutes each)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>An episodic narrative puzzle game set in a world where sci-fi, horror, and childhood perspective collide, exploring quantum physics, supernatural phenomena, and cult experiments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark mystery unfolds\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow five-year-old Martin and his friends as they uncover a twisted cult\u2019s secrets in a town where reality is breaking down, filled with sci-fi elements and mysterious experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story with Sci-Fi and Psychological Thriller Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle and Exploration Gameplay, uncovering secret experiments in a sci-fi setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art Style with Immersive Sound Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Chapters (15-20 minutes each)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>An episodic narrative puzzle game set in a world where sci-fi, horror, and childhood perspective collide, exploring quantum physics, supernatural phenomena, and cult experiments.</p>",
    "short_description": "Join five-year-old Martin in a silent town where quantum distortions twist reality. Trapped by The Eternal Light and their &quot;macroscopic parity violation,&quot; he fights to escape. Children\u2019s blood fuels experiments, as friendship, sacrifice, and control blur the lines between life and death.",
